This marker puts the application into PORTABLE mode when the screenshot tool runs
it, so ApplicationDataPaths.Current.RootDirectory becomes this output folder
instead of %LocalAppData%\Resonalyze.

Without it a sweep drives a real Form1 against the developer's own profile: the
settings saver and Form1_FormClosing flush whatever the run touched — the EQ
Wizard bank it cleared, the audio configuration it fell back to when the
interface was absent — over their working setup, and every measurement it loads
lands in their measurement history.

Re-taking documentation must not cost anyone their configuration.
